@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
hide methods
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title ERD logic — nghiệp vụ, không thay ERD vật lý
left to right direction
entity "accounts" as L_accounts
entity "account_branches" as L_account_branches
entity "teachers" as L_teachers
entity "branches" as L_branches
entity "programs" as L_programs
entity "program_levels" as L_program_levels
entity "courses" as L_courses
entity "school_classes" as L_school_classes
entity "class_sessions" as L_class_sessions
entity "students" as L_students
entity "enrollments" as L_enrollments
entity "placement_assessments" as L_placement_assessments
entity "placement_exceptions" as L_placement_exceptions
entity "exams" as L_exams
entity "grades" as L_grades
entity "final_results" as L_final_results
entity "tuition" as L_tuition
entity "payments" as L_payments
entity "class_result_barriers" as L_class_result_barriers
L_accounts ..> L_account_branches : phân công
L_accounts ..> L_teachers : hồ sơ theo role
L_branches ..> L_school_classes : scope ID
L_teachers ..> L_school_classes : phân công ID/HTTP
L_programs ..> L_program_levels : thang
L_courses ..> L_school_classes : mở lớp
L_school_classes ..> L_class_sessions : buổi thực tế
L_students ..> L_enrollments : lượt học
L_school_classes ..> L_enrollments : danh sách đăng ký
L_students ..> L_placement_assessments : đầu vào
L_placement_exceptions ..> L_enrollments : chấp nhận ngoại lệ
L_school_classes ..> L_exams : ID/HTTP
L_exams ..> L_grades : chấm điểm
L_enrollments ..> L_final_results : kết quả theo lượt học
L_enrollments ..> L_tuition : billing root ID/HTTP
L_tuition ..> L_payments : phiếu thu ID
L_class_result_barriers ..> L_final_results : khóa phối hợp shared schema
legend bottom
 Các đường trong sơ đồ logic chỉ quan hệ nghiệp vụ, không tuyên bố FK.
 Cardinality / khóa / nullable chính xác: ERD vật lý và từ điển V013.
 Shared schema có owner logic; không vẽ thành bốn database độc lập.
endlegend
@enduml
